OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with any showers dying out. A
OL,7,Fdry start to the night but thicker
OL,8,Fcloud and patchy rain will soon spread
OL,9,Feastwards to all areas by dawn. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cool and cloudy day is
OL,13,Fexpected with outbreaks of rain,
OL,14,Fperhaps turning heavy at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,17,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,18,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,19,Fshowers on Tuesday. Showers turning
OL,20,Fheavy and thundery on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
